[style name="style"]
do GameManager.set_dialogue_on(true)
join conserje center
if {Events.atrapado_conserje} == true:
	conserje: YOU AGAIN?!
	conserje: Can't you see I'm mopping the floor?!?!
else:
	conserje: HEY YOU!
	conserje: Watch your steps, I'm working here.
	set {Events.atrapado_conserje} = true
if {Dictionary.Sorry} == true:
	- I'm sorry...
		conserje: Hmph. At least this one apologises.
		conserje: All I ask for is for a bit of formality.
		if {Dictionary.Formality} == false:
			main_character: Could you elaborate?
			conserje: I don't know.
			conserje: Being treated with respect, maybe even getting a compliment from now and then woludn't be bad.
			main_character: (I guess that's a way to convince humans.)
			set {Dictionary.Formality} = true
conserje: Try to be more careful next time. Do you think this floor cleans itself?
if {Dictionary.Sorry} == false:
	do GameManager.subtract_wave(1)
leave conserje [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]
main_character: (Is every non-student as angry? The janitor's salary must be non-existent.)
leave main_character [animation="Slide To Right" wait="true"]
do GameManager.set_dialogue_on(false)